Z||000001||Greg Piet||09-12-2000||06:34 AM||||HEY!!!<BR>I have an identical Fiero  in my garage...<BR>Who did you call to take it away(a junkyard)???<BR>was it free?<P>I was going to cut it up and take it to a boneyard in the back of a little Toyota truck||||reg||1
Z||000002||Gokart||09-12-2000||06:56 AM||||Yah, I thought I was going to have to put the rims back on so it could be towed but I called around and found a salvage yard to come get it for $25.00. I to thought about cutting it up if I had to, but could you imagine how long that would take! Funny thing is that after I went to the dump and got rid of an old couch and they charged me $15.00 couch fee. I'm like "guy, I just got rid of a whole car for $10.00 more" <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> ||||reg||7
