Z||000004||Ed||09-12-2000||03:09 PM||||A member of our Sacramento, Calif. club drove his skinless Fiero across the mountains to Reno, Nevada to attend the regional there.  He was stopped once, but was deemed "street legal."  Especially unfortunately, the weather turned bad, and again, unfortunately, he was dressed only in shorts and a tee shirt!  I lent him an umbrella against the rain and snow in the mountains, and gave him a sweat shirt to wear! An umbrella because there was no top! What a sight.<p>[This message has been edited by Ed (edited 09-12-2000).]||||reg||1
